                                "sense_id": "add54cc4-4bc2-364d-9dae-3cf01759613a",
                                "text": "Ik vind hem maar een rare gozer.",
                                "translation": "I think he's a weird dude.",
                                "english": "I think he's a weird dude."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a9da3f3-686b-4f0d-a5d4-1220ef934162",
                                "sense_id": "add54cc4-4bc2-364d-9dae-3cf01759613a",
                                "text": "Goos, wat probeer je hier nou eigenlijk helemaal mee te bereiken?",
                                "translation": "Dude, what are you actually trying to achieve here?",
                                "english": "Dude, what are you actually trying to achieve here?"
